WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.392
Column pruning means the engine may read only needed
columns especially with columnar formats such

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:10.976
as Parquet and Delta This is one reason SELECT star
can be costly

00:00:11.003 --> 00:00:16.704
in large analytical work It may be fine during
exploration but

00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:20.165
production transformations should choose needed
columns deliberately
